id: pm-vcs-ttc0
title: Served repository over the Phase 3 transport
description: "A served repository exposing refs, objects and the series over the Phase 3 transport in engine/transport.ts. Spec only — tracked as an open child for a future pass."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-28T13:43:10.824Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-05T07:05:36.273Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: pi-agent
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
